{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，近二十年來，蘋果一直對其「搖錢樹」iPhone進行「擠牙膏式」升級。但是，這一局面將在周五改變。蘋果將正式開始銷售其首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo，押注這款設備能像當年iPhone改變智能手機那樣，重塑規模尚小的摺疊屏手機市場。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583526.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.835869+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:34:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"e0df2f31c33ed2fa37c542ec537e6af4f05f25d4d11c3a9e7d249193125a3645","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}